Meta.documentation:String.indexOf
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Finds the position of one String inside another.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first String in the flow is the subject, the second is
Meta.documentation:what to search for. Emits the position of the first
Meta.documentation:occurrence, or −1 when not found.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_subject — the String to search in
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_search — the String to find
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the position, −1 when absent
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:hello String:llo]>>String.indexOf:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:2
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see String.substring
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

